we are sure you all know about peek but  did you know that there are actually  other cart titan users in the show well  don't worry if you didn't know that  because in today's video we will be  explaining all cart titan users in  attack on titan pete grew up in the  liberio internment zone in marley she  joined the warrior program as soon as  she was eligible so she could provide  proper medical care for her father after  performing well enough to be selected to  inherit one of them are land titans she  was chosen to be the next cart titan in  her titan form pique is only 4 meters  tall and usually walks on all fours her  torso is long and flat allowing for  materials to be easily packed onto her  back its long face allows for custom  armor and machine guns to be strapped to  it this is standard wear for the kart  titan when it is an action five years  into the paradise island operation peak  journeys to paradise island with zeke  yeager she is seen in their titan form  behind zeke as he screams and turns all  of the villagers of rigako into titans  they both later join reiner and bertolt  as the survey corps go on an expedition  to reclaim shigan china district pete  keeps watch for their movement overnight  upon seeing the advancing soldiers she  returns to the ruins of shigan china and  informs zeke reiner and bertolt of their  approach as the battle begins she stays  with beast titan all the time because  the kart titan has much lower defenses  than the other nine titans and will be  taken down by a critical or severe blow  she provides zeke with rocks to crush  and throw at the soldiers and keeps  brittles hidden in a barrel atop her  back as a plan b against the survey car  the soldiers choose to engage in a  suicidal charge against the beast titan  in order to buy time for captain levi to  move in for a counter attack as zeke  decimates them he is quickly caught off  guard and defeated by levi before zeke  can be captured pete comes to his rescue  and carries his injured human body away  they retreat to shiganshina district but  only managed to rescue reiner as the  survey corps already defeated bertolt  four years later peak's cart titan can  be seen at the battle of fort slava at  the climax of the war between marley and  the mid-east allied forces once  anti-titan artillery is destroyed both  her and porco engage enemy forces after  defeating the enemy at fort slava the  four-year-long war between marley and  mid-east ends when the survey corps  launched an attack on marley pique and  galliard are led into an empty building  where they both get trapped soon after  escaping they both join the battle peak  stumbles off the roof of the building  and falls after being struck by a  barrage of thunderspears she is  momentarily saved by the sudden  intervention of falco who shields her  from jean after the battle during an  emergency meeting peak theorizes that  zeke jaeger has been planning his raid  with a team of co-conspirators from  inside the marlene military and they  decide to launch a surprise attack  immediately peak infiltrates paradise  island in order to gain information  after galliard's failed attempt to  capture aaron peake falls off the roof  and transforms equipped with an  anti-titan artillery cannon pique  declares that they cannot allow aaron  and zeke to come into contact with each  other after being attacked by enemy  soldiers pique exits her titan form and  hides in the steam of her titan's  decaying body making it look as though  she has been killed afterwards macca  flands a direct hit on zeke's beast  titan knocking him off the wall aaron  makes contact with zeke to start the  rumbling and peek grips the wall as it  begins to disintegrate beneath her peek  and maggoth later agree to join forces  with the survey corps to stop aaron pika  sent to scout paradises dox to see if it  will be safe for the group to follow  aaron but when she returns she reveals  that the jaegers have occupied the docks  and are keeping azumabitos hostages she  uses her titan form to transport the  members of their group who are unable to  fight after leaving the non-combatants  on a boat in the harbor she joins her  comrades in a fight against jaegers they  manage to escape and use the flying boat  to get close to aaron pete grabs the  explosives and drags them out of the  boat with her transforming midair pique  transports the explosives into titan's  mouth while her comrades engage the  beast titan pique tries to rush to his  nape on her own and use the explosives  to kill him she manages to set the  explosives around aaron's snape but  before she can set them off she gets  impaled by warhammer titan peak's  regeneration abilities reach their limit  and leave her unable to heal her  injuries requiring gene to return and  save her while we all know and love  everything about peak we don't get to  learn much about other kart titans  throughout history but we do see some in  the battle of heaven and earth when all  the past titan shifters are summoned by  aaron and ymir the first titan we are  introduced to is okapi kart titan it  catches armon off guard and eats them it  has okapi head but the rest of the body  looks quite normal unlike the nexcart  titan we're going to show you this titan  looks absolutely amazing there is a lot  of speculation about whether it is a  beast cart or even a jaw titan but the  way this titan walks using all four legs  as well as the look of its jaws has  convinced us that this is most likely a  cart titan it has a very strange  appearance it seems to be a mixture of  human and crocodile in the chapter 135  we can also catch a wolf-like cart titan  in the background our artist did an  excellent job of drawing him so that you  could see better how it looks like we  also get a glimpse of the first ever  kart titan in the chapter about ymir  fritz's past the first ever kart titan  looked very similar to peak's cart titan  it had a normal titan body and the only  clear difference to peaks titan is the  horse-shaped head click on this video to  learn more about all female titans in  attack on titan why are you still here  click it
 

